("log.errPhotoNone","I couldn't see any food in that photo. Try a closer shot, or type it instead.","इस फोटो में खाना नहीं दिखा। पास से फोटो लें, या लिखकर बताएँ।"),
("log.errPhoto","Couldn't read that photo. Try another one, or type your meal.","यह फोटो पढ़ नहीं सका। दूसरी फोटो लें, या लिखकर बताएँ।"),
